# The tables ARE tracked, so every number behind a panel can be checked
# without re-running anything, as are the Newick tree and iTOL annotation
# files needed to rebuild Figure 4d. The rendered figures are not: they are
# in the published article, and git stores binaries badly.
results/logs/
results/qc/
results/figures/panels/
results/Source_Data.xlsx
results/figures/**/*.png
results/figures/**/*.svg
results/figures/**/*.pdf

# Metadata with exact age and health centre - never commit
data/metadata/samples_metadata_internal.tsv
data/metadata/*_internal.tsv

# Logs and scratch
*.log
tmp/

# Stray device output from Rscript
Rplots.pdf

# Private working notes for the proofs - not part of the public archive
NOTES_FOR_PROOFS.md
